# The model owns selection and expansion. Collapsing the server of the
# focused buffer focuses its console (the server row); focusing a buffer
# under a collapsed server expands it. Closing the focused buffer focuses
# the one above it.
! welcome
< :textual!u@h JOIN #a
> MODE #a
< :bob!b@h PRIVMSG textual :hi
? buffers = console #a bob
? expanded yes
! focus #a
! collapse
? expanded no
? focus console
! collapse
? expanded no
! expand
? expanded yes
? focus console
! collapse
! focus bob
? expanded yes
? focus bob
# With the console focused, a collapse leaves the focus alone.
! focus console
! collapse
? focus console
! expand
! focus bob
! close bob
? buffers = console #a
? focus #a
# Closing a joined channel leaves it.
! close #a
> PART #a :Textual GTK
? buffers = console
? focus console
! close console
? buffers = console
< :textual!u@h PART #a
? buffers = console
? registered textual
